    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a64cd47b7625fdc4090c50e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这次“有马纪念”\n对她来说不只是一般比赛，\n背后有着非常重大的意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1805f954fa191aacf720e339135ae4236d9afd70249a2c43f42ad7192e471522",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
