    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d91b677e5ddc0cd48f31f6cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她毫无迷惘地谈论着未来的参赛计划。\n她的话语之中──\n从未提到“鲁道夫象征”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ae9a72faf1787fab368b5e7f33fae4f889f3cff8dca20dea445824fb544e131",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        59,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/59/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:587237b0d4c41577fcbd4279",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如同鬼火一样燃烧的眼神，\n仅仅一瞬间就牢牢锁定天狼星象征。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98e1449918c38b287c2a0f75637fec0a85bf0d9836046ddba2f82c95031b6392",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070309.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0d3f01b72cb7d02c6258151",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070309.json",
      "json_path": [
